  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial stable release\n\n🔮 Reflection API Features:\n- MessageDescriptor and FieldDescriptor classes\n- IFieldAccessor for dynamic field access\n- Type-safe field accessors\n- AOT-friendly metadata generation\n- Zero System.Reflection dependency\n\n🚀 AOT Compatibility:\n- Compile-time metadata generation\n- Zero runtime reflection\n- NativeAOT compilation support\n- No IL trimming issues\n- Full performance optimization\n\n📊 Use Cases:\n- Dynamic message processing\n- Generic serialization frameworks\n- Validation and inspection tools\n- Debugging and logging utilities\n- Metadata-driven operations\n\n💡 Design Philosophy:\n- Zero reflection = Zero runtime overhead\n- Compile-time generation = Maximum optimization\n- Immutable metadata = Thread safety\n- Type-safe accessors = Compile-time checking\n\n🎯 Generated API:\n- Message.Descriptor - Static metadata\n- Message.GetFieldAccessors() - All field accessors\n- Type-safe GetValue/SetValue methods\n- HasValue/Clear methods for each field",
